{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet","id":432041,"title":"Werewolf 2e and the internet","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-07T17:47:03-08:00","id":432041,"title":"Werewolf 2e and the internet","content":"Reading through 2e and just finished up the tribes. While I was reading about the Iron Masters I got to thinking - how would this technology-oriented tribe view the internet? Might they be able to reconsider their territory as an online forum or mmorpg instead of a physical place? Maybe some might actually stake out and protect server locations hosting websites they feel connected to? Or maybe they just white knight on their own special forums. <br /> <br /> I apologize if anything later in the book gets around to discussing it. Interested in hearing any other ideas how Iron Masters (or others) might view the web as space to be claimed and protected.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5220-mother-s-love","name":"Mother's Love","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T18:01:00-08:00","id":432067,"title":"","content":"I doubt they would use the internet as a replacement for physical territory. They would very likely use it as a supplement, a tool for managing that territory, and also just for how much fun the internet can be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T18:10:15-08:00","id":432082,"title":"","content":"I feel like that little sidebar back in the 1e core that mentions the existence of digital location-spirits is worth mentioning here as a curiosity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T18:36:24-08:00","id":432098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432082#post432082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel like that little sidebar back in the 1e core that mentions the existence of digital location-spirits is worth mentioning here as a curiosity.</div> </div> </div> </div>It has been so long since I read the 1e core that I completely forgot about that one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Revlid wrote:<br /> Yes, hollowing out your humanity to become an utterly utilitarian asura is the exact suggestion I would expect from you, Aiden.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/168-aiden","name":"Aiden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar168_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1431"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T18:48:38-08:00","id":432107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432082#post432082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel like that little sidebar back in the 1e core that mentions the existence of digital location-spirits is worth mentioning here as a curiosity.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Can you point out a page number on that so I can go look it up?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5220-mother-s-love","name":"Mother's Love","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T18:58:04-08:00","id":432112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mother's Love</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432107#post432107\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Can you point out a page number on that so I can go look it up?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Location Spirits&quot; sidebar, page 266.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T19:13:56-08:00","id":432131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432112#post432112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;Location Spirits&quot; sidebar, page 266.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thanks, that is an interesting idea. (To summarize for anyone unable or too lazy to go look it up: location spirits can combine with nearby, potentially dissimilar location spirits to form a 'larger' location spirit. The same being said to happen with spirits relating to virtual locations.) <br /> <br /> \u200b<br /> Otherwise, in response to Aiden: I agree they'd definitely use technologies for hunting. That seems to be the emphasis for Iron Masters. But I can imagine a high humanity basement dweller, seething in Dalu form, frustrated that he can't use his werewolf abilities to dominate in LoL or CoD. (or whatever the latest popular version is). Or I could envision an ex-IT Ilatheur who goes out of his way to block or banish malware spirits passing through his server. Or maybe, on a darker note, an Iron Master who will seek you out, no matter where you exist in the world, if he perceives you invading or violating his online territory. <br /> <br /> Werewolves were all once just normal folk, and many many normal folk now take to the internet like a second home. I think that instinct would be hard to give up, even after the change. <br /> <br /> But again, I'm happy and interested to hear other thoughts on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5220-mother-s-love","name":"Mother's Love","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T00:27:17-08:00","id":432395,"title":"","content":"Another thing to mention, is that according to Book of Spirits, the internet extends to the shadow. Im sure there are some iron masters taking advantage of that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T11:23:28-07:00","id":432807,"title":"","content":"Wasn't the Lodge of Wires' whole thing that they tried to control the internet spirit/spirits, got slaughtered and then reformed trying to work with them instead of control them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3497-urbicamortis","name":"UrbicaMortis","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T11:37:30-07:00","id":432822,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>UrbicaMortis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432807#post432807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wasn't the Lodge of Wires' whole thing that they tried to control the internet spirit/spirits, got slaughtered and then reformed trying to work with them instead of control them?</div> </div> </div> </div>Where is they full write up? In 2ed corebook they are not...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T11:39:33-07:00","id":432828,"title":"","content":"Tribes of the Moon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T12:50:37-07:00","id":432989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432828#post432828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tribes of the Moon.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thank you - and nice icon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5220-mother-s-love","name":"Mother's Love","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T13:04:18-07:00","id":432994,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>UrbicaMortis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432807#post432807\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wasn't the Lodge of Wires' whole thing that they tried to control the internet spirit/spirits, got slaughtered and then reformed trying to work with them instead of control them?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah. Originally the lodge tried to harness the spirit of the Internet, but after they were almost completely wiped out for their efforts, they rebuilt and went about studying it instead. The totem is Digital Eye. Most are unaware that Eye is the Lord of Surveillance. Like ArcaneArts said it's in Tribes of the Moon, on page 137.<br /> <br /> I'm always surprised Werewolf hasn't expanded more on that. I know Werewolf the Apocalypse had more emphasis on the Internet with the 'Cyberrealm,' but I don't know much about it. There's a Claimed who first thought she was talking to an AI in the Book of Spirits, called Cray. The book also talks about the significant presence of computers in the Shadow on page 74, and a sort of invisible 'connection between every computer reflection in the Shadow' with spirits taking advantage of the various kinds of addicts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T13:10:49-07:00","id":433001,"title":"","content":"Internet spirits are definitely an interesting area to study, both in-universe and out. I mean, how often does a spirit go from nothing to the presumably godlike power of the Internet Spirit in a matter of mere decades? <br /> <br /> There are potentially Uratha around who spoke to the thing when it was a mere Jaggling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T13:30:31-07:00","id":433028,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=433001#post433001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Internet spirits are definitely an interesting area to study, both in-universe and out. I mean, how often does a spirit go from nothing to the presumably godlike power of the Internet Spirit in a matter of mere decades? <br /> <br /> There are potentially Uratha around who spoke to the thing when it was a mere Jaggling.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well it probably had a constant stream of lesser spirits of technology, information, communication, speed, freedom, privacy, lust, money, and pretty much anything else you can think of being constantly thrown at it. It probably couldn't even eat them all fast enough. These days, it's likely one of the biggest, fattest <i>magath</i> ever created.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T14:00:56-07:00","id":433096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432994#post432994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yeah. Originally the lodge tried to harness the spirit of the Internet, but after they were almost completely wiped out for their efforts, they rebuilt and went about studying it instead. The totem is Digital Eye. Most are unaware that Eye is the Lord of Surveillance. Like ArcaneArts said it's in Tribes of the Moon, on page 137.<br /> <br /> I'm always surprised Werewolf hasn't expanded more on that. I know Werewolf the Apocalypse had more emphasis on the Internet with the 'Cyberrealm,' but I don't know much about it. There's a Claimed who first thought she was talking to an AI in the Book of Spirits, called Cray. The book also talks about the significant presence of computers in the Shadow on page 74, and a sort of invisible 'connection between every computer reflection in the Shadow' with spirits taking advantage of the various kinds of addicts.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <i>Two figures look at each other, for beings of rage and power, they had worried faces.<br /> <br /> &quot;Will this stop it?&quot; one asked, preparing to cut the cable.<br /> <br /> Another looks on at his discarded phone. &quot;You know as well as I that you can't stop it. You can only delay it. The Net sees damage and routes around it&quot;</i><br /> <br /> <i>Other gives an exasperated growl. &quot;Why. Of all the spirits, does this one give us the most trouble!?&quot;<br /> <br /> The Iron Master produced a pipe and gave a deep puff. &quot;The Net wants to expand. To build bridges, to cross gaps. Free and unrestricted.&quot;<br /> <br /> He paused.<br /> <br /> &quot;It wants to encompass everything. It wants to be ever present, omniscient</i>. <i>Not to tyrannize even though it does have have that element, but simply to be there and let the data roam.&quot;<br /> <br /> The other stopped digging.<br /> <br /> &quot;So it wants to build it's own Pangaea!&quot;<br /> <br /> The Iron Master chuckled. &quot;Of sorts. It wants to be there but not touching. Manifesting but not Claiming. It's been collecting everyone's dirty secrets. The real question is what does it plan to do with them.&quot;<br /> <br /> The other was about to reply when the shove struck the cable. He jerked wildly as light and electricity seized control over the being's body. It spoke in quick, binary gasps.<br /> <br /> &quot;Farsil Luhal, Uratha. Avatar, provided. Input, waiting.&quot; <br /> <br /> The Iron Master gave another puff. He hated using another Uratha like this but he needed to know.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tell me about the Tipping Point.&quot;<br /> <br /> The Avatar gave a jerky smile. </i><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T16:34:44-07:00","id":433265,"title":"","content":"Yes, I think having the internet as a territory is a viable way to go. I suppose they might be looked down upon by some more traditionalist werewolves, but online predators don't have to be solely human, and even those who only go online sparsely can still be targets for various spirits. The aforementioned Cray is sort of put out there was more of a neutral party, one who may be willing to help, but nothing is keeping a spirit of vice or addiction to start lurking around some site's servers, encouraging further use among its more loyal members. In the book Night Horrors: Wolfsbane, there's even a Pure werewolf who specifically uses the internet to find wolf-blooded children and abduct them. The internet can be a place for predators, so it's fitting place for some of the Forsaken.<br /> <br /> It doesn't seem to jibe with the original Lodge of Wires, but it doesn't even have to be something confined to the Iron Masters. The Hunters in Darkness tend to be protective over certain areas, and a forum or online community might fit. A pack like that might face a lot of problems with extraterritoriality, since they would likely have to poach through the domains of other werewolves in order to reach their prey, so they might have to have a sort of diplomatic face, unless they decided to go about their hunts quickly and covertly, an option that might be necessary if their prey is in a Pure or other tumultuous territory. A Lodge might fit for the concept, as it would allow for more international reach, like the Internet. Werewolves might be able to travel across countries and states but occasionally a prey might be overseas, in which case they might contact a pack in the region.<br /> <br /> I could see them developing a lot of more tech-savvy fetishes, and fetishes that alter existing Gifts to be more appropriate for their hunt. And of course with all the internet and computer spirits they would be bound to have some interesting, if limited, Gifts.<br /> <br /> From a Storyteller standpoint it would be an interesting way to run an 'on the road' type story, or use them as NPCs. How does the pack feel about these People claiming there's a predator in their midst they were unaware of they'd already declared Siskur-dah on?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T17:36:02-07:00","id":433321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432994#post432994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Most are unaware that Eye is the Lord of Surveillance. </div> </div> </div> </div>In a previous werewolf game I ran there was a spirit of surveillance that turned magath. I'm happy to hear the concept has been explored in other places. In that game it was focused more on neighborhood surveillance rather than data snooping. Still, interesting. <br /> <br /> The internet offers up endless new ideas for spirits, and even ways of expressing the hisil. I love hearing about other people's ideas on it. <br /> <br /> However, my original question really was more focused on ways that werewolves might embrace the internet, or parts of the internet, as their territory. I'd like to think and hear more ideas about how it might go, what problems might pop up, basically things I didn't think of that make sense or are dramatically interesting. <br /> <br /> Currently in final planning stages for 2e werewolf, but still reading the book. Thanks for the all the interesting conversation. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5220-mother-s-love","name":"Mother's Love","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T18:44:39-07:00","id":433400,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mother's Love</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432989#post432989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432828#post432828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tribes of the Moon.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thank you - and nice icon.</div> </div> </div> </div>... Now kiss...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T19:00:36-07:00","id":433417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mother's Love</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=432989#post432989\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Thank you - and nice icon.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're welcome, and thanks-It's here until Friday.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ephsy</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">... Now kiss...</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://csimadmax.deviantart.com/art/dear-teacher-cheerilee-today-I-learned-284186832\" target=\"_blank\">Ephsy, did you already forget what MLP taught you about shipping?</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 03-08-2015, 10:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T11:28:03-07:00","id":434267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=433417#post433417\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://csimadmax.deviantart.com/art/dear-teacher-cheerilee-today-I-learned-284186832\" target=\"_blank\">Ephsy, did you already forget what MLP taught you about shipping?</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Your flattery will get you nowhere.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/576-ephsy","name":"Ephsy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar576_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2615"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T13:09:04-07:00","id":434447,"title":"","content":"Oh,well then, by all means continue.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T13:20:31-07:00","id":434461,"title":"","content":"I love internet spirits; my last game took the concept pretty far. You can easily use the Shadow's flexable space to have &quot;the internet&quot; be another location entirely, accessable through what in my last game I called &quot;tubes&quot;. It works just like other spirit world areas (glades, shouls, etc.) but all the &quot;tubes&quot; connect to each other, regardless of distance, but you can't actually leave through a different one unless you have the proper numina. So my players could hope into a tube and talk to (or attack) spirits from all across the world but everything they did was observed and judged. Some of the other packs treated tubes like Wounds and actively tried to close them.<br /> <br /> I even had a few websites that acted as Loci: most of them were private support groups or charity websites but one porn site was an extremely powerful source of essence.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/785-full-time-gm","name":"Full Time GM","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar785_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T15:17:10-07:00","id":434651,"title":"","content":"In my last Werewolf campaign, I stuck an idigam in the Internet:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/383282-idigam-the-silicon-empress\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...ilicon-empress</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Eric Christian Berg</b><br /> <i>Onyx Path Freelancer</i><br /> Promethean: The Created Second Edition, Dark Eras Companion","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2019-eberg","name":"eberg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2019_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"284"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T15:41:22-07:00","id":434736,"title":"","content":"You can make them Places-That-Aren't like Full Time GM did, or make them their own locations instead of connectors.<br /> <br /> The porn site is a city sized brothel, the fantasy football league a stadium the size of the grand canyon, IGN exists as a place where numbers only start at seven, you can get to any of these places from anywhere in the Shadow that has Spirits of connection or electricity or of the 'net. You need to placate them though, they're the only ones with the keys ( or numina) to access it.<br /> <br /> Possibilities are endless.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4134-gilbod","name":"GilboD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T23:59:33-07:00","id":435395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GilboD</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/432041-werewolf-2e-and-the-internet?p=434736#post434736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can make them Places-That-Aren't like Full Time GM did, or make them their own locations instead of connectors.<br /> <br /> The porn site is a city sized brothel, the fantasy football league a stadium the size of the grand canyon, IGN exists as a place where numbers only start at seven, you can get to any of these places from anywhere in the Shadow that has Spirits of connection or electricity or of the 'net. You need to placate them though, they're the only ones with the keys ( or numina) to access it.<br /> <br /> Possibilities are endless.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I like this concept. I'm not familiar with the shoals or glades, but I get the idea. When travelling to these places, what happens when you want to return back through the gauntlet? Is it simply not possible? Can you use travel through these places as &quot;shortcuts&quot; to distant areas in the Shadow, or in the real world? It starts making me think about the Changeling's Hedge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5220-mother-s-love","name":"Mother's Love","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T09:52:19-07:00","id":435847,"title":"","content":"You could. You're the Storyteller (presumably) so it's your call. It's RAW that the Shadow doesn't fit 1:1 with the real world, and that some places are larger or smaller than others and that yes, like the Hedge, time is not always consistent. There are shortcuts. There are other places out there.<br /> <br /> What I would do if someone burst out from one of these places using Gifts or powers to forcefully cross rather than a locus, would be to put them at a locus. One place in the world that is feeding them enough to bend the rules. I'd make the locus very weak and fleeting, one dot at most, as the spirits who don't hunt these Places-That-Aren't are getting their full and the place only gets a tax. Much like connections to the net this place get its Essence not locally, but globably.<br /> <br /> And because of that I'd do it again and again with a different part of the world each time they tried.<br /> <br /> Could this result in a short cut to people fapping across the world? Maybe. If they really pursue it I might even focus an entire chronicle on it. It's a good storyhook and shows off how weird the Shadow is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4134-gilbod","name":"GilboD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T10:18:30-07:00","id":435887,"title":"","content":"Okay, so the natural extension of this is, whether it's the Silicon Empress restructuring the Internet, a gambling-spirit Claimed using its influence over the net to hook other people and grab essence through its site, or Gatherer Wolf contacting wolf-blooded children online before kidnapping them, how would you or your pack deal with it?<br /> <br /> Are you going to go to Tuvalu to nail that gambling spirit, maybe destroy all the other servers wherever they are? Assemble some sort of international protectorate to attack the Empress, or another internet-based idigam from all sides? When Gatherer Wolf's only moment in your territory is to pick up a misguided Wolf-blood before driving three states away, who goes after them? What do you do with your own territory while you're gone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T10:27:17-07:00","id":435901,"title":"","content":"Yeah that sounds like a Chronicle spanning story-hook right there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4134-gilbod","name":"GilboD","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T14:50:31-07:00","id":436293,"title":"","content":"I have to admit, as massive as the internet is for spirit potential (I agree with GiboD) part of me wonders if that's why we haven't seen it in the actual books. The thing would just be so <i>massive</i>. How would you deal with it? What would it want? What would the spirit even be like? How do you wrap the cultural influence from all over the globe that creates its own culture and is attached every emotion know to man into one conglomerate of a spirit? The potential really is nearly endless. What would it look like in the Shadow? Part of me wonders if the internet itself truly represented in spirit form it would be endless, and what would that do to the shadow overall? I think that perhaps to try and come out with a definitive 'canon' answer for us in the books might only be limiting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1705-okami","name":"Okami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1705_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T15:08:26-07:00","id":436319,"title":"","content":"Like everything else on that level of power, the Spirit of the Internet would be beyond the reach of most Uratha, and probably in the umia of another sort of spirit, like a digital or machine spirit. But since it is a world-spanning thing you'd have 'lesser' spirits taking charge in certain areas where the internet is more heavily used or people are more reliant on it. Just like the Moon, or the Sun or other big spirits. And those spirits of the Internet ilthum could in some places become corrupt or usurped in power, or do whatever the storyteller requires to spin a story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}